Also there are the many giants in the Quest.  A valkyrie should be able
to reach STR: 18/** by doing a cycle of eating a giant corpse then
retreating up a level until no longer Satiated.  I've gotten most of the
way there just on the first level of the Quest cycling through the
portal each time.  Killing the many giants gives a lot of experience
points but likely not enough to get deeper into the Quest - It seems
tuned to require other means than combat to gain levels.


